---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
---
<Base
  title="Marketing Performance Group — See Who's Buying in Your Market"
  description="Right now, 200+ homeowners in your market are researching the job you do. We know their names — email, phone, address — and put your ads in front of them and only them. Not shared. Not resold. Yours. 2X revenue guarantee or we work free."
>
  <!-- Minimal top nav — logo only; everything else moved to footer -->
  <nav class="mp-nav">
    <div class="mp-nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="mp-logo">
        Marketing Performance Group
        <span class="mp-logo-sub">Powered by EngageEngine™</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="mp">

    <!-- ═══ 1. HERO ═══ -->
    <section class="mp-hero">
      <div class="mp-hero-grid">
        <div class="mp-hero-copy">
          <h1 class="mp-h1">
            <span class="hero-word">Right </span>
            <span class="hero-word">now, </span>
            <span class="hero-word">200+ </span>
            <span class="hero-word">homeowners </span>
            <span class="hero-word">in </span>
            <span class="hero-word">your </span>
            <span class="hero-word">market </span>
            <span class="hero-word">are </span>
            <span class="hero-word">researching </span>
            <span class="hero-word">the </span>
            <span class="hero-word">job </span>
            <span class="hero-word">you </span>
            <span class="hero-word">do. </span>
            <span class="hero-word">We </span>
            <span class="hero-word">know </span>
            <span class="hero-word">their </span>
            <span class="hero-word">names.</span>
          </h1>
          <div class="mp-hero-prose hero-sub">
            <p>Before a homeowner calls anyone, they search, read reviews, and compare — invisibly. We identify those <strong>specific people</strong> — name, email, phone, address — and put your ads in front of them and <em>only</em> them. Not shared with competitors. Not resold. Yours.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-cta mp-hero-cta-block">
            <a href="/snapshot" class="mp-btn-primary">See Who's Buying in My Market</a>
            <p class="mp-micro">Free. No email required. Takes 30 seconds.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mp-hero-trust mobile-hide">
            <div class="mp-guarantee-chip">
              <span class="mp-chip-check">✓</span>
              <span>Backed by the <strong>2X Revenue Guarantee</strong>: it pays for itself twice over in 90 days, or we work free until it does.</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mp-cred-line"><strong>31 years. Zero refunds.</strong> Not because we don't offer them — because we've never needed to.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Snapshot artifact — actual buyer intent pull -->
        <figure class="mp-artifact">
          <img
            src="/img/intent-snapshot-hvac.png"
            alt="Buyer intent pull — Columbia, SC HVAC, May 25 2026: 233 active searchers identified, 85 multi-site visitors, 85 uncaptured (no contact made), competitor exposure locked until activation. Contact data preview blurred."
            class="mp-artifact-img"
            loading="eager"
          />
          <figcaption class="mp-artifact-cap">Actual buyer intent pull · Columbia, SC HVAC · Last 72 hours</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 2. PROBLEM (enemy + agitation) ═══ -->
    <section class="mp-problem">
      <div class="mp-problem-inner">
        <p class="mp-eye" data-animate>The Problem</p>
        <h2 class="mp-h2" data-animate data-delay="0.05">You don't have a lead problem. You have a <em>shared</em> lead problem.</h2>
        <div class="mp-problem-prose" data-animate data-delay="0.1">
          <p>You've tried it: Angi, HomeAdvisor, Thumbtack. You pay for a "lead" that got sold to four competitors before your phone finished ringing. You race to call first, quote against three guys who'll go cheaper, and win maybe one in five — the price-shoppers.</p>
          <p>Or you've run ads the old way: blasting a whole zip code and paying Google and Facebook to show your ad to renters, tire-kickers, and people who replaced their roof last year.</p>
          <p>Here's the math nobody shows you: in a typical service market, fewer than <strong>3 in 100</strong> households are in-market for you this quarter. Old-way advertising pays to reach all 100. Shared-lead platforms make you fight over the three.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="mp-problem-punch" data-animate data-delay="0.15">Both models are built so the platform wins whether you do or not.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 3. SOLUTION (named mechanism) ═══ -->
    <section class="mp-solution">
      <div class="mp-solution-inner">
        <p class="mp-eye" data-animate>The Solution</p>
        <h2 class="mp-h2" data-animate data-delay="0.05">We stopped guessing who might buy. We find who's <em>already deciding.</em></h2>
        <div class="mp-solution-prose" data-animate data-delay="0.1">
          <p><strong>The EngageEngine™</strong> — our buyer-identification system — reads the research trail homeowners leave before they ever pick up the phone: the searches, the review pages, the comparison visits. It resolves that activity to real, named people in your service area, and puts your ads in front of those people only — on Google, Facebook, YouTube, everywhere they go.</p>
          <p><strong>Why it works:</strong> an in-market homeowner behaves differently — they binge reviews, compare maps, check three websites in a week. That behavior is visible now in ways it wasn't three years ago. We simply refuse to spend a dollar of your money on anyone who isn't doing it.</p>
          <p>And they're <strong>exclusively yours.</strong> One company per trade, per market. When you hold your territory, your competitor can't buy it. That's not a marketing tactic — that's the product.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 4. PROOF (stacked) ═══ -->
    <section class="mp-proof-section">
      <div class="mp-proof-block">
        <p class="mp-eye mp-center" data-animate>The Proof</p>
        <h2 class="mp-h2 mp-center" data-animate data-delay="0.05">"In 30 days we doubled our booked appointments."</h2>
        <div class="mp-proof-feature" data-animate data-delay="0.1">
          <div class="mp-anchor-photo">
            <img src="/img/rogerson.jpg" alt="McClintock HVAC" width="80" height="80" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
          <div class="mp-anchor-body">
            <p class="mp-anchor-attr"><strong>McClintock HVAC</strong> · Charlotte, NC</p>
            <div class="mp-anchor-stats">
              <span><strong>70%</strong> lower cost per click</span>
              <span class="mp-dot">·</span>
              <span><strong>2×</strong> booked appointments</span>
              <span class="mp-dot">·</span>
              <span>30 days</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="mp-proof-stack" data-animate data-delay="0.15">
          <li><strong>31 years</strong> in this industry. <strong>Zero refunds ever issued.</strong></li>
          <li>Serving service businesses across HVAC, plumbing, roofing, fencing, drilling, landscaping and more. <strong>$500K–$5M revenue.</strong></li>
          <li class="mp-proof-founder">
            <img src="/img/robbie-butt.jpg" alt="Robbie Butt, Founder" class="mp-proof-founder-photo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            <div>
              <p class="mp-proof-founder-quote">"I personally sign every client. If it doesn't work, I keep working. That's been the deal for 31 years."</p>
              <p class="mp-proof-founder-attr">— <strong>Robbie Butt</strong>, Founder</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 5. OFFER (value stack) ═══ -->
    <section class="mp-offer">
      <div class="mp-offer-inner">
        <p class="mp-eye mp-center" data-animate>What You Get</p>
        <h2 class="mp-h2 mp-center" data-animate data-delay="0.05">What you get when you take your market.</h2>
        <ul class="mp-stack" data-animate data-delay="0.1">
          <li class="mp-stack-item">
            <div class="mp-stack-head">Your Buyer List, refreshed daily</div>
            <p class="mp-stack-body">Every in-market homeowner in your territory, identified by name.</p>
            <div class="mp-stack-anchor">What data brokers charge <strong>$2,500+/mo</strong> for.</div>
          </li>
          <li class="mp-stack-item">
            <div class="mp-stack-head">Fully managed campaigns</div>
            <p class="mp-stack-body">Google, Facebook, YouTube — built, run, and optimized for you.</p>
            <div class="mp-stack-anchor">A <strong>$2,000/mo</strong> agency retainer, aimed at named buyers.</div>
          </li>
          <li class="mp-stack-item">
            <div class="mp-stack-head">The Invisible-Visitor Pixel</div>
            <p class="mp-stack-body">The 97% who visit your site and leave without calling — we tell you who they were and follow up automatically.</p>
            <div class="mp-stack-anchor"><strong>$1,500/mo</strong> standalone.</div>
          </li>
          <li class="mp-stack-item">
            <div class="mp-stack-head">Market Exclusivity</div>
            <p class="mp-stack-body">Your trade, your territory, locked.</p>
            <div class="mp-stack-anchor"><em>Priceless — ask the guy who doesn't get it.</em></div>
          </li>
          <li class="mp-stack-item">
            <div class="mp-stack-head">One monthly number that matters</div>
            <p class="mp-stack-body">Leads, source, and cost per booked job. No dashboards to learn.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="mp-stack-total" data-animate data-delay="0.15">
          Total comparable value: <strong>$6,000+/month.</strong><br/>
          <span class="mp-stack-total-sub">(Not counting market exclusivity — which no competitor can sell you at any price.)</span>
        </p>

        <div class="mp-offer-price" data-animate data-delay="0.2">
          <p class="mp-price-eye">Your Investment</p>
          <p class="mp-price-headline">
            <span class="mp-price-num">$3,500</span><span class="mp-price-per">/month</span>
            <span class="mp-price-plus">+ ad spend</span>
          </p>
          <p class="mp-price-body"><strong>Month to month. No contracts.</strong> The guarantee is on our fee, not your ad spend: <strong>$3,500 in → at least $7,000/month in closed revenue within 90 days</strong>, or we keep working until it does. Free.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mp-offer-do" data-animate data-delay="0.25">
          <p class="mp-offer-do-yes"><strong>Here's what you do:</strong> tell us your service area, tell us what a good job looks like, answer the phone.</p>
          <p class="mp-offer-do-no"><strong>Here's what you don't:</strong> everything else.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 6. RISK REVERSAL — The Guarantee ═══ -->
    <section class="mp-guarantee">
      <div class="mp-section-head mp-center">
        <p class="mp-eye" data-animate>The Guarantee</p>
        <h2 class="mp-h2" data-animate data-delay="0.05">The 2X Revenue Guarantee.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="mp-guarantee-card" data-animate data-delay="0.1">
        <div class="mp-guarantee-badge">
          <span class="mp-badge-check">✓</span>
          <span>2X Revenue Guarantee</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mp-guarantee-lead">If the system doesn't produce at least twice your investment in closed revenue within 90 days, we keep working for free until it does.</p>
        <p class="mp-guarantee-body">You risk nothing but the 30 seconds it takes to look at your market.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 7. URGENCY + FINAL CTA (territory availability) ═══ -->
    <section class="mp-close">
      <h2 class="mp-close-h1" data-animate>One company per trade, per market.</h2>
      <p class="mp-close-h2" data-animate data-delay="0.05">Is your territory still open?</p>
      <p class="mp-close-body" data-animate data-delay="0.1">We can't sell your market twice — that's the whole point. If your competitor claims it first, we'll be sending <em>them</em> the buyers.</p>
      <div class="mp-close-cta" data-animate data-delay="0.2">
        <a href="/snapshot" class="mp-btn-primary">See Who's Buying in My Market — Check If My Territory Is Open</a>
        <p class="mp-micro">Free. No email required. Takes 30 seconds.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     APPLE-FIDELITY HOMEPAGE — Hormozi rewrite
     Tokens: Canvas White #f5f5f7 · Pure White #ffffff
     · Midnight Graphite #1d1d1f · Mid Gray #707070
     · Interactive Blue #0071e3 · Border Silver #d6d6d6
     · Cards 0px radius · Images 8px · Buttons 980px pill
     · Shadow XL: rgba(0,0,0,0.22) 3px 5px 30px 0px
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

  /* ─── Top nav (logo only) ─── */
  .mp-nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
    backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .mp-nav-inner {
    max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px; height: 56px;
    display: flex; align-items: center;
  }
  .mp-logo {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--graphite);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px;
    min-height: 44px; justify-content: center;
  }
  .mp-logo:hover { color: var(--graphite); text-decoration: none; }
  .mp-logo-sub {
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--mid-gray);
  }

  /* ─── Page base ─── */
  .mp { background: var(--canvas); color: var(--graphite); }
  .mp h1, .mp h2 { font-family: var(--font-d); color: var(--graphite); }
  .mp p { color: var(--graphite); }
  .mp em { font-style: italic; }

  /* ─── Primary button (Apple Interactive Blue pill) ─── */
  .mp-btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    background: var(--blue); color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-t); font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 980px;
    text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .mp-btn-primary:hover { background: var(--blue-link); text-decoration: none; color: #fff; }
  .mp-btn-primary::after {
    content: "→"; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .mp-btn-primary:hover::after { transform: translateX(3px); }

  /* ─── Eyebrows + headings ─── */
  .mp-eye {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .mp-h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-d);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.4vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em; color: var(--graphite);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .mp-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-d);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3.8vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em; color: var(--graphite);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    max-width: 780px;
  }
  .mp-h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--blue); }
  .mp-lede {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em; color: var(--mid-gray);
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .mp-micro {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--light-gray);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .mp-section-head { margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .mp-section-head.mp-center,
  .mp-h2.mp-center,
  .mp-eye.mp-center { text-align: center; }
  .mp-section-head.mp-center .mp-h2,
  .mp-section-head.mp-center .mp-lede { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .mp-h2.mp-center { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

  /* ─── 1. HERO ─── */
  .mp-hero {
    padding: 80px 32px 100px;
    background: var(--canvas);
  }
  .mp-hero-grid {
    max-width: 1320px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .mp-hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(360px, 500px) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 64px;
    }
  }
  .mp-hero-copy { max-width: 520px; }
  .mp-hero-prose {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 540px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .mp-hero-prose p {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    color: var(--mid-gray);
  }
  .mp-hero-prose p strong {
    color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600;
  }
  .mp-hero-cta-block {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .mp-hero-trust {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;
    padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .mp-guarantee-chip {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--graphite);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .mp-guarantee-chip strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .mp-chip-check {
    width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--blue); color: #fff;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .mp-cred-line {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--mid-gray); max-width: 500px;
  }
  .mp-cred-line strong { color: var(--graphite); font-weight: 600; }

  /* Snapshot artifact — actual product screenshot, framed Apple-style */
  .mp-artifact {
    margin: 0;
    justify-self: stretch; width: 100%;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;
  }
  .mp-artifact-img {
    width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl, rgba(0,0,0,0.22) 3px 5px 30px 0px);
    background: var(--white);
  }
  .mp-artifact-cap {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--light-gray);
    text-align: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .mp-artifact { max-width: 100%; }
  }

  /* ─── 2. PROBLEM ─── */
  .mp-problem {
    padding: 112px 32px;
    background: var(--white);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .mp-problem-inner {
    max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .mp-problem-prose {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;
    margin: 28px 0 36px;
  }
  .mp-problem-prose p {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    color: var(--mid-gray);
  }
  .mp-problem-prose p strong {
    color: var(--graphite); font-weight: 600;
  }
  .mp-problem-punch {
    font-family: var(--font-d);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 26px);
    font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--graphite);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  /* ─── 3. SOLUTION ─── */
  .mp-solution {
    padding: 112px 32px;
    background: var(--canvas);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .mp-solution-inner {
    max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .mp-solution-prose {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .mp-solution-prose p {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    color: var(--graphite);
  }
  .mp-solution-prose p strong {
    color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ─── 4. PROOF (stacked) ─── */
  .mp-proof-section {
    padding: 112px 32px;
    background: var(--white);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .mp-proof-block {
    max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .mp-proof-feature {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    background: var(--canvas);
    margin: 32px 0 40px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--blue);
  }
  .mp-anchor-photo {
    width: 80px; height: 80px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-d);
    font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--mid-gray);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .mp-anchor-photo img {
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .mp-anchor-attr {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-gray);
    margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: -0.018em;
  }
  .mp-anchor-attr strong { color: var(--graphite); font-weight: 600; }
  .mp-anchor-stats {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--blue-link);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;
  }
  .mp-anchor-stats strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .mp-dot { color: var(--light-gray); }
  .mp-proof-stack {
    list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px;
  }
  .mp-proof-stack > li {
    font-family: var(--font-t);
    font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    color: var(--graphite);
    padding-left: 24px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .mp-proof-stack > li::before {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;
    color: var(--blue); font-weight: 700;
  }
  .mp-proof-stack > li strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .mp-proof-founder {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 18px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    background: var(--canvas);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--blue);
  }
  .mp-proof-founder::before { display: none; }
  .mp-proof-founder-photo {
    width: 72px; height: 72px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    object-fit: cover; object-position: top;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: rgba(0,0,0,0.12) 2px 3px 14px 0px;
  }
  .mp-proof-founder-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-d);
